OL,3,GNEWSAWhy does the legend of Sawney Bean
OL,4,Aand Scotland's cannibal clan persist?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA clan of cannibals preying on unwary
OL,7,Ftravellers brings to mind horror films
OL,8,Flike The Texas Chainsaw Massacre or The
OL,9,FHills Have Eyes.
OL,11,FHowever hundreds of years before
OL,12,FLeatherface ever revved up his
OL,13,Fchainsaw, similar gruesome tales were
OL,14,Fbeing spoken of in Scotland.
OL,16,FThe legend of Sawney Bean and his
OL,17,Ffamily has chilled generations, telling
OL,18,Fof a murderous family who attacked and
OL,19,Fthen devoured people passing near a
OL,20,Fhidden cave on the South Ayrshire
OL,21,Fcoast.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
