OL,3,GNEWSAWhy does the legend of Sawney Bean
OL,4,Aand Scotland's cannibal clan persist?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhether Bean and his relatives ever
OL,7,Factually existed is another matter, and
OL,8,Fstill provokes different opinions to
OL,9,Fthis day.
